<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-ENGLAND 166 FOR SIX IN SECOND INNINGS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 166 FOR SIX IN SECOND INNINGS.</headline>
<dateline>WANGANUI, New Zealand 1997-02-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>England were 166 for six wickets needing 363 to win against New Zealand A at the close of the third day of their four-day match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>New Zealand A first innings 181 (M. Horne 64, C. Silverwood 6-44) and 288 (L.Howell 66. A.Caddick 3-52).</p>
<p>England first innings 107 (R. Irani 40, G. Allott 4-44, H. Davis 4-22) and 166 for six wickets (N.Hussain 57. G.Allott 4-57).</p>
